{"id": "scene-tmp-00430", "text": "The criteria for the allocation of public funds shall no longer be according to the number of votes won in the general election by a political party. The new criteria shall be the proportion of seats won by a political party in the Assembly. Political parties shall receive an annual amount of 500.000 ren per Member of Assembly.\n\n\n(This results in a doubling of the USP election budget and a slight increase in the other parties in the Assembly while effectively removing all funding from parties that are below the 10% election threshold.)"}
